     2216        BUTTON-schet-one AT ROW 13.24 COL 55.2
     2217        Goods-Editor AT ROW 13.62 COL 1 NO-LABEL
     2218        BUTTON-schet-val AT ROW 15.52 COL 55.2
     2219        lkp-schet AT ROW 16.52 COL 35.6 NO-LABEL
